@startuml
title Implemented health with bounded Ollama check
actor Client
participant HealthController
participant OllamaService
participant Ollama
Client -> HealthController: GET /api/health
HealthController -> OllamaService: isAvailable()
OllamaService -> Ollama: GET /api/tags (health timeout)
alt successful JSON with models array
 Ollama --> OllamaService: 200 {models: [...]}
 OllamaService --> HealthController: true
else unavailable, malformed, HTTP error, timeout
 OllamaService --> HealthController: false
end
HealthController --> Client: 200 {status: ok, ollama: boolean}
note right of OllamaService: Service reachability; not model readiness
@enduml
